&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingSharesAndBondsEtcOfUnconsolidatedSubsidiariesAndAssociatesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPledgedAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※２．担保に供している資産&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8.5pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;
